<title>INDIA: India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 10.60 percent.</title>
<headline>India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 10.60 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund said on Monday the yield on its money market mutual fund (MMMF) as on June 16 was 10.60 percent and the rate works out to 0.000855029 rupees.</p>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund is a joint venture between India's Kothari Group and U.S. mutual fund Pioneer Inc.</p>
